From 7e9bee980a82d9e008a4bd39a248123928fbbf85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:32:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: expose typed chain fork and header synchronization
 diagnostics

Convert eight fork, invalid-chain, header progress and received-time diagnostics. Preserve message wording/newlines, Info severity and existing branch/policy behavior. Copy fork base/tip hashes directly; preserve work and percentage precision. GetReceivedTimeDiff is epoch seconds and the existing caller already applies llabs; expose that exact absolute quantity.

Scripted diff commands (ast-grep-py==0.51.0):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/chain-fork-header-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/chain-applied.json --apply
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/test_convert.py
python3 test/lint/lint-log-events.py src/validation.cpp
Support: six appended fields with explicit domains/units. Extend actual-node regression to invalidate/reconsider the isolated block. Fixtures15/15, lint50sites, Ruff0.15.8 and idempotence pass. Updated C++/runtime gate pending scheduler.
